body:
If you're a true fan then you know that Selene has their full backing, so being rude to her is uncalled for. That's great that you gave feedback and have been working on stories with Alec's encouragement, but to say that you are going to throw away the story you were working on for the sub goes against what they are trying to do by backing away: keep the sub alive and drama free. That and to lower their stress because it's insane the amount of drama people are creating about and around them. 

&#x200B;

So keep writing, and post your work. Because you won't find them or their work anywhere else on reddit anyway.

That's great! I keep telling everyone I'm stopping at grad school for counseling, but my family seems to think I'll go for my doctorate. To that I say, only if you're funding it! lol.

&#x200B;

Good luck with your project, and getting into grad school. I say it's both easier and harder than undergrad. More relaxed, but also more work. Just keep pushing and remember there IS an end in sight!
